{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/extras/003ca694a8c80546cb2a556d77218c0d.avif?t=1757187990\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hermit and Pig set out one morning to forage mushrooms and avoid human interaction. When a girl from a nearby village shows up asking for help, they are plunged into a conspiracy well above their pay grade. Which is zero dollars.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Leave your comfort zone!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your wits about you as you travel far outside your comfort zone to hunt for a giant, mythical mushroom. Your path will be filled with corporate stooges, weird cultists, rival truffle hunters, and uncharacteristically violent animals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/extras/a3385fa1129233a7e189b0ff31cff78a.poster.avif?t=1757187990\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/extras/a3385fa1129233a7e189b0ff31cff78a.webm?t=1757187990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/extras/a3385fa1129233a7e189b0ff31cff78a.mp4?t=1757187990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle against dangerous attackers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master attack techniques AND mushroom knowledge to (hopefully) survive and (maybe) gain experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/extras/79f0c6edfd0eb35b8a90080171a6f7cf.poster.avif?t=1757187990\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/extras/79f0c6edfd0eb35b8a90080171a6f7cf.webm?t=1757187990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/extras/79f0c6edfd0eb35b8a90080171a6f7cf.mp4?t=1757187990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chat with the locals!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do your best to avoid taking CRINGE DAMAGE! <i>Navigate your social anxiety and follow the clues to solve the mystery!</i> And maybe even receive a gift or two if you\u2019re really charming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/extras/a7e8a80beb0b23828b4d025142595582.poster.avif?t=1757187990\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/extras/a7e8a80beb0b23828b4d025142595582.webm?t=1757187990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/extras/a7e8a80beb0b23828b4d025142595582.mp4?t=1757187990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forage for mushrooms, truffles, and trinkets!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mushrooms and truffles will help you defend yourself. Equip trinkets to enhance Hermit and Pig. <i>No offense to them, but they need all the help they can get.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/extras/4a7443fd1be29d232927b32daeef1e4d.poster.avif?t=1757187990\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408350/extras/4a7443fd1be29d232927b3